        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Exit Only Block Off Plate for Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is exit only block off plate for Global <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-stainless-steel-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbarss\"><b>Stainless Steel Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Exit Devices</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/44-inch-grade-2-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-edtbar44\"><b>44 Inch Rim Exit Devices</b></a> and others. Packaged with  mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUsed to cover a pre drilled bore hole. This blank plate is used when installing a <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device</b></a> on doors with pre drilled bore holes that do not require any exterior entry product such as a  <a href=\"/products/entry-lever-for-panic-device-global-th1100-lhed\"><b>Entry Door Lever</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global TH1100-PLEO-AL Block Off Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Aluminum </li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Sex Bolts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
